According to our statistics, the total number of active devices today is 1,520, with approximately 20% of the devices affected. We take every user's experience very seriously and have immediately started to fix this issue.

For our small team, account suspension is a devastating blow. We sincerely hope you can give us an opportunity to rectify the issue so that we can promptly address this problem and restore user trust in our application.

Thank you for your time and consideration. We look forward to your positive response.
